      prompt: "Unity negative feedback around $G=36/[s(s+3)]$. Compute $\\zeta$, $\\omega_n$, $T_s$, and $\\%OS$.",
      answer: "$\\omega_n=6$, $\\zeta=1/4$, $T_s=8/3$ s, $\\%OS=100e^{-\\pi/\\sqrt{15}}$.",
