      prompt: "Unity negative feedback, $G=K/[s(s+8)]$. You need $\\%OS=16.3\\%$ ($\\zeta=1/2$) and you would like $T_p$ as small as possible.\n\nWhat $K$ meets the overshoot, and can $T_p$ be reduced further without changing $\\zeta$?",
